OL,3,GNEWSAHotelier and sister killed mum
OL,4,Awith morphine, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA well-known hotelier and his sister
OL,7,Fkilled their 100-year-old mother by
OL,8,Fgiving her liquid morphine to "speed
OL,9,Fup" her death, a court has heard.
OL,11,FOxford restaurateur Jeremy Mogford, 79,
OL,12,Fand Sarah Pickering, 72, deny murdering
OL,13,Ftheir mother, Pamela Mogford, in
OL,14,FBledlow Ridge, Buckinghamshire.
OL,16,FShe died aged 100 at about half-past
OL,17,Fmidnight on 15 February 2022, a jury in
OL,18,FOxford Crown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
